(QuickBite FAQs - Questions and Answers) Tj
T*
(==============================================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( 1. Q: How to track my order?) Tj
T*
(    A: Open the app dashboard and check your order list. You can also type 'order status) Tj
T*
(       <order_id>' in chat.) Tj
T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
( 2. Q: How to cancel an order?) Tj
T*
(    A: You can cancel an order only before the restaurant starts preparing it. Go to Order) Tj
T*
(       Details and tap Cancel.) Tj
T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
( 3. Q: What are delivery charges?) Tj
T*
(    A: Delivery charges depend on distance, restaurant policies, and surge conditions. The) Tj
T*
(       final fee is shown at checkout.) Tj
T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
( 4. Q: What if my order is late?) Tj
T*
(    A: If your order is delayed, please wait for status updates in tracking. If the delay is) Tj
T*
(       significant, contact support from the order page.) Tj
T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
( 5. Q: Can I change delivery address?) Tj
T*
(    A: Address changes are possible only before dispatch and only if the new address is within) Tj
T*
(       serviceable range.) Tj
T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
( 6. Q: How do I apply a coupon code?) Tj
T*
(    A: At checkout, enter your coupon in the promo code field and click Apply to see the) Tj
T*
(       updated total.) Tj
T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
( 7. Q: How can I contact customer support?) Tj
T*
(    A: Use the Help section in the app and select your order to start a support chat or) Tj
T*
(       request a callback.) Tj
T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
( 8. Q: What payment methods are accepted?) Tj
T*
(    A: We support UPI, credit/debit cards, net banking, and selected wallets depending on your) Tj
T*
(       location.) Tj
T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
( 9. Q: How do I request a refund?) Tj
T*
(    A: Open the order details, choose Help, and submit a refund request with your issue) Tj
T*
(       details.) Tj
T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(10. Q: Can I schedule an order for later?) Tj
T*
(    A: Yes, many restaurants allow scheduled delivery. Choose a future time slot during) Tj
T*
(       checkout if available.) Tj
T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(11. Q: Is there a minimum order amount?) Tj
T*
(    A: Some restaurants set a minimum order amount. If applicable, you will see it on the) Tj
T*
(       restaurant page before checkout.) Tj
T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(12. Q: How long does delivery usually take?) Tj
ET
