(13. Q: Can I edit my order after placing it?) Tj
T*
(    A: Order edits are usually possible only before the restaurant starts preparing your food.) Tj
T*
(       Open order details and check if Edit is available.) Tj
T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(14. Q: What if an item is missing or wrong?) Tj
T*
(    A: Open the order in Help and report missing or incorrect items with details or photos for) Tj
T*
(       faster resolution.) Tj
T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(15. Q: Is cash on delivery available?) Tj
T*
(    A: Cash on delivery is available only for eligible orders and locations. You will see it) Tj
T*
(       as a payment option at checkout when supported.) Tj
T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(16. Q: How can I get an invoice for my order?) Tj
T*
(    A: After delivery, open order details and download the invoice or receipt from the billing) Tj
T*
(       section if available.) Tj
T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(17. Q: Can I reorder a previous order?) Tj
T*
(    A: Yes, go to your order history and use Reorder on any eligible past order.) Tj
